Package: sharepointless
Type: Package
Title: One-Line Access to 'SharePoint' Document Libraries
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Geordie", "McRuer", , "geo.mcruer@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wraps 'Microsoft365R' and 'AzureGraph' in consistent, pipe-friendly
    less_* functions so routine 'SharePoint' work takes one line: stored sign-in
    details, a cached delegated sign-in, opening sites and document libraries
    from the URL you copied out of your browser, and plain-language errors.
    The raw 'Microsoft365R' objects stay available for anything not wrapped.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/mcruer/sharepointless
BugReports: https://github.com/mcruer/sharepointless/issues
